  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "fc82b114-1bc2-45ac-81cf-7917096908ec",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Column Classification**\\\n",
    "Based on the metadata expected data dictionaries and our initial inspection, we can broadly classify the features into distinct groups. This helps structure our cleaning and analysis steps later . we have identified several boolean columns that are currently stored as object strings(e.g Yes/No)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 117,
   "id": "b5bc04da-94f2-40ea-b170-3737b0bb6c18",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Target Variable:is_claim\n",
      " ID Column:policy_id\n",
      "\n",
      " Numerical columns(15):['policy_tenure', 'age_of_car', 'age_of_policyholder', 'population_density', 'make', 'airbags', 'displacement', 'cylinder', 'gear_box', 'turning_radius', 'length', 'width', 'height', 'gross_weight', 'ncap_rating']\n",
      "\n",
      " Categorical columns(11):['area_cluster', 'segment', 'model', 'fuel_type', 'max_torque', 'max_power', 'engine_type', 'is_adjustable_steering', 'rear_brakes_type', 'transmission_type', 'steering_type']\n",
      "\n",
      " Boolean columns(17):['is_esc', 'is_adjustable_steer', 'is_tpms', 'is_parking_sensors', 'is_parking_camera', 'is_front_fog_lights', 'is_rear_window_wiper', 'is_rear_window_washer', 'is_rear_window_defogger', 'is_brake_assist', 'is_power_door_locks', 'is_central_locking', 'is_power_steering', 'is_driver_seat_height_adjustable', 'is_day_night_rear_view_mirror', 'is_ecw', 'is_speed_alert']\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "target ='is_claim'\n",
    "id_col = 'policy_id'\n",
    "bool_cols_raw =[\n",
    "    'is_esc','is_adjustable_steer','is_tpms','is_parking_sensors',\n",
    "    'is_parking_camera', 'is_front_fog_lights', 'is_rear_window_wiper',\n",
    "    'is_rear_window_washer','is_rear_window_defogger','is_brake_assist',\n",
    "    'is_power_door_locks' , 'is_central_locking', 'is_power_steering',\n",
    "    'is_driver_seat_height_adjustable','is_day_night_rear_view_mirror',\n",
    "    'is_ecw','is_speed_alert'\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "num_cols_raw = df.select_dtypes(include=['int64','float64']).columns.tolist()\n",
    "num_cols_raw = [c for c in num_cols_raw if c not in [target, id_col]]\n",
    "\n",
    "cat_cols_raw = df.select_dtypes(include=['object']).columns.tolist()\n",
    "cat_cols_raw = [c for c  in cat_cols_raw if c not in bool_cols_raw and c not in [id_col]]\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Target Variable:{target}\")\n",
    "print(f\" ID Column:{id_col}\")\n",
    "print(f\"\\n Numerical columns({len(num_cols_raw)}):{num_cols_raw}\")\n",
    "print(f\"\\n Categorical columns({len(cat_cols_raw)}):{cat_cols_raw}\")\n",
    "print(f\"\\n Boolean columns({len(bool_cols_raw)}):{bool_cols_raw}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d30e23c1-dc2d-4f47-a493-19619d1a209b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Summary of the Initial above observations:**\\\n",
    "\n",
    "    . Data Types: Many features are stored as objects(strings). The boolean flags ('Yes/no') need to be converted to integers (1/0) for modelling.\n",
    "    . Complex Strings: max_power and max_torque contain compound information(value and rpm). These must be parsed into seperate numeric columns.\n",
    "    . Missing values: The outer join likely introduced missing values so we need to detailed audit it."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "9eb232c6-eb3a-45ee-ac24-67c3f15fefd5",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Phase 3"
