   "source": [
    "**Interpreting Missing Values and Check for Duplicates**\\\n",
    "Duplicates can skew our Analysis. If policy_id is duplicated butthe row isn't fully identical which meand it implies conflicting records for the same policy. Full row duplicates are simply redundant and should be removed.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 119,
   "id": "a844e018-e9b9-440c-9831-f6b67083bd43",
