   "source": [
    "**Explaining Boolean Values**\\\n",
    "We need to check the boolean values inorder to avoid inconsistencies because these inconsistencies prevent simple mapping and require explicit string stripping before converting to binary 1/0"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 120,
   "id": "670263a1-872a-460a-a0b3-1e850e7ffaf9",
