   "source": [
    "**String -Encoded Numeric Issue**\\\n",
    "max_torque and max_power embed numerical values along with units(Mn,bhp) and engine speed at which they are achieved (@ X rpm). we need to extract the raw numerical values to utilize these as features in an machine learning model."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 121,
   "id": "76d24679-9b91-4251-8960-9e34e2439179",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
