   "source": [
    "plt.figure(figsize=(10, 8))\n",
    "crosstab = pd.crosstab(df_clean['area_cluster'], df_clean['is_claim'], normalize='index') * 100\n",
    "\n",
    "sns.heatmap(crosstab, annot=True, fmt=\".2f\", cmap=\"YlOrRd\", cbar_kws={'label': 'Percentage (%)'})\n",
    "plt.title('Heatmap: Claim Percentage by Area Cluster', fontsize=14, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "plt.ylabel('Area Cluster')\n",
    "plt.xlabel('Is Claim')\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d6981121-60ef-40de-b043-1250fe4add0a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Inference** \\\n",
    "The heatmap shows that non-claims dominate every area cluster, accounting for approximately 89.58%–96.14% of observations. Claim rates are relatively low, ranging from 3.86% to 10.42%. C18 has the highest claim percentage (10.42%), while C17 has the lowest (3.86%), suggesting C18 may warrant further investigation as a potential claim hotspot."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6f49eb2a-31d3-4c6a-ac95-4dbbf3c86bd0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
